===persian===

های...
جنگ...
جانم را...
که در فاصله
نفس های عاشقانه شکل می گیرد	



===machine===
Hey...
War...
My soul...
That is formed in the distance
of romantic breaths

===translation===

Ah struggle…

Y’know my soul was molded
In those distances
Between a lover’s breathing


